Single-Page PNGs — Content per file (filenames below)

Filenames and core text to render on each PNG variant (vertical 1080x1920 and square 1200x1200 versions):

1) pngs/RoleBased_MicroChecklist_bride.png
Header: Bride — Wedding Day Checklist
24 hrs before:
- Confirm timeline with planner
- Pack emergency kit
- Confirm vendor arrival & payments
Morning:
- Light breakfast + hydrate
- Final outfit check
At ceremony:
- Arrive at ceremony venue
- Follow entrance cues
Vendor handoff:
- Collect receipts
- Confirm transport

2) pngs/RoleBased_MicroChecklist_groom.png
Header: Groom — Wedding Day Checklist
24 hrs before:
- Confirm groomsmen timing & suits
- Pack emergency kit (tie, cufflinks, shoes polish)
Morning:
- Eat breakfast + hydrate
- Confirm suit fit
At ceremony:
- Arrive on time with groomsmen
- Know ring handoff plan
Vendor handoff:
- Confirm transportation for tuxes/suits
- Collect vendor receipts

3) pngs/RoleBased_MicroChecklist_moh.png
Header: Maid of Honor — Wedding Day Checklist
24 hrs before:
- Confirm bride needs & timeline
- Pack emergency kit (safety pins, tissues)
Morning:
- Assist bride with dressing
- Keep timeline & contacts handy
At ceremony:
- Manage bouquet & bustle
- Hold bride's items
Vendor handoff:
- Coordinate bridesmaids
- Confirm any vendor instructions

4) pngs/RoleBased_MicroChecklist_bm.png
Header: Best Man — Wedding Day Checklist
24 hrs before:
- Confirm rings & groomsmen details
Morning:
- Keep groom punctual
- Bring emergency kit (needle/thread)
At ceremony:
- Hold rings / coordinate groomsmen
Vendor handoff:
- Oversee transportation of groom's items

5) pngs/RoleBased_MicroChecklist_parents.png
Header: Parents — Wedding Day Checklist
24 hrs before:
- Check guest list & seating changes
- Confirm transportation for VIPs
Morning:
- Coordinate arrival of family members
At ceremony:
- Be ready for seating or cue responsibilities
Vendor handoff:
- Help with guest direction & vendor communication

6) pngs/RoleBased_MicroChecklist_vendors.png
Header: Vendors — Wedding Day Checklist
24 hrs before:
- Confirm arrival & setup times
Morning:
- Deliverables check (flowers, cake, AV)
At ceremony:
- Onsite contact: [name/phone]
Vendor handoff:
- Packdown instructions & pickup times

7) pngs/RoleBased_MicroChecklist_officiant.png
Header: Officiant — Wedding Day Checklist
24 hrs before:
- Confirm ceremony script & vows
Morning:
- Confirm arrival time & microphone needs
At ceremony:
- Review processional & recessional cues
Vendor handoff:
- Confirm certificate sign-off and handing over

